      </div>
      <div class="tl-row">
        <span class="tl-year">2021</span>
        <div><strong>First database</strong>. Took on IT Specialist at Yayasan Madinah Salam, maintaining MySQL through phpMyAdmin. 3rd place in the Baznas national creative video competition.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-row">
        <span class="tl-year">2022</span>
        <div><strong>Building the engineering side</strong>. Web coding training at HalalCode (Jan–Jul), R and SQL certifications from DQLab, then the PWA/Android/iOS bootcamp at IOI (Aug, 48 sessions). 2nd place in the UIN Imam Bonjol national creative video competition. Served as Chairman of LDF An-Nuur.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-row">
        <span class="tl-year">2023</span>
        <div><strong>The plan proved out</strong>. Web &amp; Mobile Development bootcamp at IOI (Feb, 50 sessions). 1st place in the ANMPC Marketing Plan Competition at Universitas Andalas, 1st place in the MTQ Qur'an Application Design category, and a national finalist at MTQMN XVII, Universitas Brawijaya. Graduated in December with a 3.77 GPA.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-row">
        <span class="tl-year">2024</span>
        <div>Joined <strong>Telkomsel</strong> in customer service, Customer Care and Retention, running genuinely complex Telkomsel and Telkom programmes face to face with customers.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-row">
        <span class="tl-year">2026</span>
        <div><strong>My turn to build the programmes</strong>. Data Analyst &amp; IT Development at PT Infomedia Nusantara. From running programmes to building the analytics that hold them up.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
